Lightricks Layout-To-Render example workflow
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The Render graph (app/server/l2r/graph.ts, snapshots app/workflows/l2r_layout-to-render*.api.json)
was rebuilt in ComfyUI API format from Lightricks' official two-stage distilled Layout-To-Render
workflow for LTX-2.5, at its default settings, with optional mid / end keyframe guides added and the
inputs set by the app at submit time. The LoRA and the LTX-2.5 weights it loads are under the LTX-2.x Community License Agreement (2026-08-11,
https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x; a copy is in LICENSES/LTX-2-Community-License.txt)
and are not redistributed here. This repository's graph files were modified from Lightricks' workflow
(rebuilt in ComfyUI API format, optional mid and end keyframe guides added); they carry this notice that they
were changed. Outputs made with them are machine-generated and are disclosed as such; the licence forbids
removing or circumventing watermark or provenance features, and the app does not strip any. Entities with annual
revenue of US$10M or more need a paid licence from Lightricks to use LTX-2.x for anything but non-commercial R&D.

